    "rendered": "Personal Data and Cookies"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Welcome to Stathis Company. The security and protection of your personal data is a priority for us. The data we collect and process is used exclusively to provide and improve our services, in full compliance with GDPR.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Who are the recipients of your data:</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Technology solution providers</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Accounting and financial services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Accounting and supply chain companies</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Marketing and advertising services (with your consent)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Your Rights under the GDPR:</strong> You have the right of access, rectification, erasure and portability of your data, as well as the right to perpetuate or request restriction of processing.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>About Cookies</strong>:We use cookies to improve your online experience. These help us understand your preferences and tailor content accordingly. You can manage your cookie settings through your browser.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Contact</strong>: for any questions or information about how we process your data, you can contact us at: gdpr@stathis.com.gr</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">or write to us at:<br>DOUNAS THEOCHARIS &amp; CO S.A.<br>Sindos Industrial Area, Entrance Β’, PB. 1134 <br>Postal Code: 57022, Thessaloniki</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">or call us at +30 2310 79 8300</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
